  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "BasisOS is a decentralized trading platform that enables automated basis trading strategies across spot and derivatives markets. It provides vaults, oracles, and position managers to execute and manage these strategies on Arbitrum One and Base.",
    "relationship_narrative": "The BasisOS family uses a single deployer cluster and shared proxy infrastructure (UpgradeableBeacon, BeaconProxy, ERC1967Proxy) to manage all contracts. Vaults (LogarithmVault) rely on SpotManager/XSpotManager for spot execution, OffChainPositionManager for derivatives, and LogarithmOracle for pricing, while StrategyConfig and OffChainConfig provide parameters, and GasStation handles gas management.",
